[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8281.429, "timestamp": "02:18:01", "text": "好的，我听你的。嗨，我会听的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8285.11, "timestamp": "02:18:05", "text": "你只是我的，只是我的，呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8289.07, "timestamp": "02:18:09", "text": "向前，不是向下，就是向前向上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8292.03, "timestamp": "02:18:12", "text": "像楼梯之类的东西，对，走吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8299.75, "timestamp": "02:18:19", "text": "楼梯，等等，你想让我放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8301.349, "timestamp": "02:18:21", "text": "我无法点亮灯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8304.07, "timestamp": "02:18:24", "text": "不，没事，嗯，也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8308.429, "timestamp": "02:18:28", "text": "有效，哦，我的天哪，是的，去试试吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8310.99, "timestamp": "02:18:30", "text": "向上，你正在向下运动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8316.19, "timestamp": "02:18:36", "text": "没错，向上，就像不要……嗯，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8318.549, "timestamp": "02:18:38", "text": "就像那样，做一个楼梯吻，耶耶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8321.03, "timestamp": "02:18:41", "text": "对，就像那样，往上 ..."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8323.429, "timestamp": "02:18:43", "text": "我们为什么要上去？我需要，我们需要走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8325.629, "timestamp": "02:18:45", "text": "我需要给你看点东西，好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8327.669, "timestamp": "02:18:47", "text": "我们走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8331.91, "timestamp": "02:18:51", "text": "向下，对，我们下去吧，好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8332.79, "timestamp": "02:18:52", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8336.99, "timestamp": "02:18:56", "text": "小心点，哦等等，哦，好的，你可以下去了"}]